
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Many thanks to ACCU for inviting me back again this April. It was my first time back to ACCU (and only my second trip to Europe) since the pandemic began, and it was a delight to see many ACCUers in person again for the first time in a few years.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I gave this talk, which is now up on YouTube here:</p>



